OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with persistent and
OL,6,Foccasionally heavy rain spreading
OL,7,Fnorth in the morning. Further showery
OL,8,Frain in the afternoon, occasionally
OL,9,Fheavy with a chance of thunder.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FScattered heavy showers at
OL,12,Ffirst with a chance of thunder, these
OL,13,Fgradually easing through the evening.
OL,14,FCloudy overnight with scattered light
OL,15,Fshowers.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FCloudy with dry spells and
OL,18,Fa scattering of showers, generally
OL,19,Flight at first with the odd heavy
OL,20,Fshower possible later. Breezy later
OL,21,Faround the west coast and the Isles.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
