OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FLargely dry and bright on Thursday.
OL,7,FMostly cloudy on Friday and Saturday
OL,8,Fwith showers or longer spells of rain
OL,9,Fat times.
